# Files executed inside Linux containers must keep LF line endings. With
# core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default), a fresh checkout would otherwise rewrite
# them to CRLF and bash would fail on `$'\r': command not found` inside the harness.
*.sh          text eol=lf
*.py          text eol=lf
Dockerfile    text eol=lf
*.yml         text eol=lf
